,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Visual design of the header. Gradient Hero: soft theme-color gradient. Split: text beside an image. Minimal: page title row with actions and a divider. Image Overlay: text over a darkened image. Dotted Grid: centered text on a fading dot grid. Card Header: record header card with icon tile. Centered Icon: large ringed icon above centered text. Wave Bottom: tinted band ending in a wave. Glass Panel: frosted panel on a color field. Eyebrow: editorial type with an accent rule.'
);
